OL,3,ALate September warmth before wind and
OL,4,Arain returns this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vast area of low pressure in the
OL,7,FAtlantic is set to draw warm south to
OL,8,Fsouth-easterly winds across the UK
OL,9,Fearly this week, but for some rain will
OL,10,Fnot be far behind.
OL,12,FTuesday looks as if it will be the
OL,13,Fwarmest day and after that temperatures
OL,14,Fwill generally return closer to the
OL,15,FSeptember average.
OL,17,FMuch of the UK can also expect a spell
OL,18,Fof wetter and windier weather from the
OL,19,Fapproaching depression, with the most
OL,20,Funsettled conditions likely to affect
OL,21,FScotland, Northern Ireland and western
OL,22,Fparts of England and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
