OL,3,ALate September warmth before wind and
OL,4,Arain returns this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, many central, southern and
OL,7,Feastern areas of England, which have
OL,8,Fbeen affected by drought, may see far
OL,9,Fless rain.
